/* WORLD MIXTAPE — country signature dishes (dossier "What they eat" section).
   Single-source map, same pattern as COUNTRY_MUSIC / COUNTRY_TIMELINES:
   keyed by country code, loaded via <script> before app.js, rendered by a
   guarded foodHtml block in openInfo(). Only countries with an entry render a
   food section — everything else stays valid.

   Each dish:  { n: name, e: emoji, f: Wikimedia Commons filename, d: kid-readable description }
   Photos resolve through wmFile()-style Special:FilePath and are Commons-verified.
   Cuba is the pilot; roll out to all 201 by adding more entries. */
